+/* JSObjectSetCustomAccessor as a custom value: `getter` makes the value on each read (an
+   embedder replaces the property with a plain value on the first, for a lazily made interface
+   object), Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor reports a data property, and `setter` takes
+   assignments; without `setter`, an assignment or Object.defineProperty replaces the property
+   with a plain value (it stays writable). Otherwise the same attributes and callbacks as
+   JSObjectSetCustomAccessor. */
